Online evidence for tests (patches/net-0009): the netplay object logs which chat lines the game gets (custom or default, per
port, once per change), and MELEE_NET_TEST_CHECKSUM=FRAME:low|high (tests only, off unless set) sends the other side wrong
checksums for the 30 finalized frames from FRAME on, so the other game's own notices can be seen: "DESYNC DETECTED" (low half)
and "Desync Risk" (high half only). Nothing changes without the variable. Applied by ../net_sources.sh after net-0008.

diff -ruN a/port/runtime/hle/slippi_online.cpp b/port/runtime/hle/slippi_online.cpp
--- a/port/runtime/hle/slippi_online.cpp
+++ b/port/runtime/hle/slippi_online.cpp
@@ -662,7 +662,21 @@
